{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10641010","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10641010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1064101001:0":{"text":"本日のお祈りはここまでです。デューラ様のご加護がありますように。","source_cn":"今日祷告至此结束。愿艾雅的圣光永远照耀着你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41010F04FF841E1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1064101002:1":{"text":"デューラ様……今日もありがとうございました。","source_cn":"艾雅在上，感谢您的布道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A4243B0D5A5A671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064101003:1":{"text":"もう時間も遅いし、私たちもそろそろ帰ろう。","source_cn":"时间不早了。咱们也回家吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80369649DD6983A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064101004:1":{"text":"そうね。ジラコ、ちゃんと修道者さんたちに挨拶するのよ。","source_cn":"好。吉拉科，记得要和修士修女们告别哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EC61B2A21A1C313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064101005:1":{"text":"大丈夫、ちゃんと分かってるって！","source_cn":"放心吧，妈妈，我记着呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58DD18EFBCFD4EF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064101006:0":{"text":"カンタギスさん、エイダさん、さようなら！","source_cn":"康塔格修士，艾达姐姐，再见！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC5B155C93C02FEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064101007:1":{"text":"はい、さようなら。","source_cn":"再见，吉拉科。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1717C15173CCFD7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064101008:1":{"text":"ジラコ君は相変わらず元気ですね。","source_cn":"吉拉科还是那么有活力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C94CBE00F242AAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064101009:1":{"text":"はは、エンサ村がこれほど平和で穏やかな時を過ごせるのも、すべては女神様と、聖堂の栄光のおかげだよ。","source_cn":"呵呵，恩莎村能拥有这样和平宁静的时光，都是仰赖女神与圣...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BEB6982AB81A3FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064101010:1":{"text":"ところで、気付いてるかい？こんな辺境の村にも、最近いくつか見慣れない顔が増えてきている。もしかしたら商売に来た人たちかもしれないね。","source_cn":"艾达修女，你没有发现吗？连我们这样偏僻的小村庄，最近都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x158392307204598A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064101011:1":{"text":"本当ですか？気付きませんでした……","source_cn":"真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC4A8D