variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064101017:1":{"text":"まさか、十年前の神魔大戦のように、またどこかで戦争なんて起きてませんよね？","source_cn":"路易莎修女，会不会是哪里又发生了战争？就像十年前的神魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0953285390664DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064101018:1":{"text":"百パーセントないとは言い切れないわ。","source_cn":"的确有这样的可能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE25FB1CBECE345B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064101019:1":{"text":"あなたの不安はよく分かる。十年前のあの戦争は、あなたに深い傷跡を残したんですもの……","source_cn":"我明白你的担忧，艾达修女。十年前的战争，给你留下了可怕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0F2036BED1E92B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064101020:1":{"text":"でも見て、エンサ村はいつも通り平和そのもの。近くの村や町で少し騒ぎがあったのかもしれないけど、心配しなくてもすぐに収まるわよ。","source_cn":"但你看，没有战火蔓延到恩莎村，很可能只是临近的村镇发生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90E757E0E251E94A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064101021:1":{"text":"でも……戦争難民が逃れてきて、エンサ村に危険をもたらすことはないのでしょうか？","source_cn":"我明白……我只是担心，战争难民逃亡过来，会不会给恩莎村...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51255F1EDE34B317","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064101022:1":{"text":"ふふ、それも大丈夫よ。もし難民が教会に助けを求めてきても、私たちにはちゃんと匿う手立てがある。","source_cn":"呵呵，不用担心。如果难民向教堂求助，我们自然有办法提供庇护。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB83C8F58CB95E31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064101023:0":{"text":"例えば……あの一番奥の戸棚。十年前もあそこに難民を隠して、敵軍の捜索をかわしたんだから。","source_cn":"比如，那只最不起眼的橱柜。十年前，就曾有人藏在里面躲避...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9D24C0AC784DD30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:32::0":{"text":"戸棚","source_cn":"橱柜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FEF9F894DC6E389","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064101024:0":{"text":"でもあの戸棚、麦袋を二つ入れるのがやっとですよね？あんな狭い場所にどうやって隠れたんですか？","source_cn":"那个只能勉强装入两袋麦谷的小橱柜吗？里面那么狭窄，难民...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0124E174E1C2ABDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064101025:1":{"text":"人は極限状態に陥ると、無限の潜在能力を発揮するの。","source_cn":"在求生时，人的潜能是无限的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x770BFDA41940EBD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","doc